                "entry_id": "0ca0fe22-d973-32a6-8502-083cc36a8a36",
                "word": "shoplifting",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "b238efe5-acc0-4810-a03f-40ff56520de2",
                        "entry_id": "0ca0fe22-d973-32a6-8502-083cc36a8a36",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "shopliftings"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d5e1d59a-42d6-3799-a05e-9b3ec0727077",
                        "entry_id": "0ca0fe22-d973-32a6-8502-083cc36a8a36",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The action of stealing goods from a shop, store or other place of business."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0141c5c7-f273-4a97-b86e-33f54defa398",
                                "sense_id": "d5e1d59a-42d6-3799-a05e-9b3ec0727077",
                                "text": "Shoplifting is one of the most prevalent crimes and it costs retailers millions of dollars each year."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f3cad51-8329-4e34-b981-c43f39e43049",
                                "sense_id": "d5e1d59a-42d6-3799-a05e-9b3ec0727077",
                                "text": "On my first day on the watch after leaving the shoplifting squad I paraded on earlies but had completely forgotten to take my ear ring off."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "16fa388d-df83-4589-b211-0239ca0b553b",
                                "sense_id": "d5e1d59a-42d6-3799-a05e-9b3ec0727077",
                                "text": "[…]William Grove for robbing his Master of twenty-sive Guineas ; and Catharine Knox for Shoplifting."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1874103c-2d5a-43fa-b98a-c760cd73a1ed",
                                "sense_id": "d5e1d59a-42d6-3799-a05e-9b3ec0727077",
                                "text": "1757 December 22, The London Chronicle, Volume II: June 30 - December 31, page 594,\nYesterday Afternoon a Woman well dreſs'd, was detected at Mr. Flint′s, a Haberdasher on London-Bridge, in Shoplifting, and on examining her, there were found on her ſome Goods belonging to Mr. Kennet, a Haberdasher at the ſame Place."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6053fb5c-64aa-30bd-93d4-873a164c2100",
                        "entry_id": "0ca0fe22-d973-32a6-8502-083cc36a8a36",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A theft from a shop during trading hours."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ea7436a-b9b6-48fe-9d2f-374e395534de",
                                "sense_id": "6053fb5c-64aa-30bd-93d4-873a164c2100",
                                "text": "In high school, he bleached his hair and began a series of shopliftings and bicycle thefts."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ec067a83-08c5-40d1-87ae-3de2f54496a9",
                                "sense_id": "6053fb5c-64aa-30bd-93d4-873a164c2100",
                                "text": "And we hardly even consider the countless robberies, shopliftings, burglaries, carjackings, kidnappings, stalkings, intimidations and harassments."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "16793b8d-5c37-46f1-af30-3ea8c70d4fd0",
                                "sense_id": "6053fb5c-64aa-30bd-93d4-873a164c2100",
                                "text": "When we described the 80-20 rule, we mentioned that 5% of the stores in Danvers, Massachusetts, accounted for 50% of the reported shopliftings."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f224e378-7b82-4bbe-bf3d-d2fb28940ef6",
                        "source_entry_id": "0ca0fe22-d973-32a6-8502-083cc36a8a36",
